<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-STRIKER HOBSCH JOINS RENNES FROM BREMEN.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-STRIKER HOBSCH JOINS RENNES FROM BREMEN.</headline>
<dateline>BREMEN, Germany 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former German international striker Bernd Hobsch signed on Thursday for French first division club Rennes after five years at Werder Bremen.</p>
<p>The 29-year-old Hobsch, who joined Bremen from east German side Leipzig in 1992, signed a two-year deal with Rennes.</p>
